      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003E442. Devilled Bones.-\u003C/b\u003E Take the bones of any remaining joint or poultry, which has still some meat on, which cut across slightly, and then make a mixture of mustard, salt, cayenne, and pepper, and one teaspoonful of mushroom ketchup to two of mustard; rub the bones well with this, and broil rather brownish.\u003Cbr\u003E"
